sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor P as Person
  participant UI as Streamlit
  participant API as API
  participant G as Pipeline
  participant AI as AI gateway
  participant DB as SQLite
  P->>UI: pick the PO, upload the PDF
  UI->>API: POST /api/cases
  API->>G: prepare: save PDF, render page
  API-->>UI: case id, at once
  G->>AI: OCR, read, classify, review
  AI-->>G: JSON (retries, backups)
  G->>DB: events, findings, model calls
  loop every second while running
    UI->>DB: read new events
    UI-->>P: stages light up, checks appear
  end
  G->>DB: outcome, reason, owner
  Note over G,DB: On hold: the run pauses in checkpoints.db
  P->>UI: Approve anyway, with a note
  UI->>API: POST /actions
  API->>G: resume from the checkpoint
  G->>DB: finalise: PO ledger
